# /opt/casa-stt/whisper.env (EnvironmentFile of whisper-server / whisper-fast). A natural sentence works better as a
# prompt than a bare list of names (a names-only prompt pushed "height" towards "light"). casa_stt.py drops a reply that
# just echoes this prompt (HALLUCINATION_RE), so keep the first words as they are.
WHISPER_PROMPT="Home Assistant voice commands and general questions. Devices: <monitor light, desk lamp, sofa light, ...>. Rooms: <office, bedroom, living room, kitchen>."
